1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:09,370
AI tools such as chatbots and translation apps have quickly become part of students’ daily learning.
聊天机器人、翻译软件等人工智能工具已迅速成为学生日常学习的一部分。

2
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:15,520
I believe AI can be a powerful learning assistant, but only if it is used appropriately.
我认为人工智能可以成为强大的学习助手，但前提是使用得当。

3
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:19,790
With proper use, AI can make learning more efficient.
使用得当，人工智能能让学习更加高效。

4
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:28,480
It can explain difficult concepts in simple language, recommend useful materials and point out grammar mistakes in students’ writing.
它能用浅显的语言讲解难懂的概念，推荐有用的资料，并指出学生写作中的语法错误。

5
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:34,070
When students get stuck on a problem late at night, AI can offer help immediately.
学生深夜被难题卡住时，人工智能可以立即提供帮助。

6
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:38,500
However, AI should support learning rather than replace thinking.
然而，人工智能应该辅助学习，而不是取代思考。

7
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:49,350
If students simply let AI write their essays or do their homework, they will miss the chance to develop their own abilities and may even be guilty of academic dishonesty.
如果学生只是让人工智能代写作文、代做作业，他们就会错失培养自身能力的机会，甚至可能犯下学术不端的过错。

8
00:00:50,150 --> 00:00:55,910
Moreover, AI sometimes produces inaccurate information, so its answers should always be checked.
此外，人工智能有时会给出不准确的信息，所以它的答案应该始终加以核实。

9
00:00:56,710 --> 00:01:00,830
Therefore, students should use AI as a tutor, not as a ghostwriter.
因此，学生应该把人工智能当作辅导老师，而不是代笔人。

10
00:01:01,630 --> 00:01:07,670
For example, they can ask it to explain an idea after first trying to understand it on their own.
例如，他们可以先自己尝试理解某个观点，再请它来讲解。

11
00:01:08,470 --> 00:01:14,430
Universities should also set clear rules on its use, so that AI truly helps students learn better.
大学也应该制定明确的使用规则，让人工智能真正帮助学生学得更好。
